{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new Shopify Online Store 2.0 section called “Featured Collection — Four Products” in the Bonne Soirée style: minimal, refined, editorial, and clean.
    
    Purpose:
    
    Display products from a selected Shopify collection in a luxury editorial product grid.
    
    Desktop layout:
    
    * Display exactly four products in a single horizontal row.
    * Use four equal-width columns.
    * Never break the four products into a second row on desktop.
    * Center the product grid horizontally.
    * Use a maximum content width of 1440px.
    * Add 32px of side padding.
    * Maintain consistent spacing between all four product cards.
    * Keep all product images the same displayed size and proportion.
    * Preserve the original image proportions without distortion.
    
    Mobile layout:
    
    * Display products in two columns.
    * Keep the section fully responsive.
    * Use 12px of side padding.
    * Maintain consistent spacing between products.
    * Do not allow horizontal page overflow.
    
    Products:
    
    * Include a Shopify collection picker.
    * Display the first four products from the selected collection.
    * Include a setting to manually adjust the number of products, with four products as the default.
    * Display the featured product image.
    * Display the product title below the image.
    * Display the product price below the title.
    * If a product has a compare-at price, display both the original price and the sale price.
    * Make the product image and title clickable.
    * Link each card to its respective product page.
    * Do not display quick-add buttons, badges, overlays, descriptions, reviews, borders, shadows, or rounded corners.
    
    Background:
    
    * Set the entire section background color to `#ebe4d8`.
    * The background color must extend across the full browser width.
    * Apply `#ebe4d8` behind the product cards, images, titles, prices, margins, gaps, and all spacing.
    * Product cards must also use the background color `#ebe4d8`.
    * Do not display any white backgrounds, white cards, white strips, or white gaps anywhere in the section.
    * Keep the same background color on desktop and mobile.
    
    Spacing:
    
    * Add adjustable top and bottom spacing settings.
    * Default desktop top and bottom spacing: 32px.
    * Default mobile top and bottom spacing: 20px.
    * Include adjustable desktop and mobile side padding.
    * Include an adjustable gap between product cards.
    
    Settings:
    
    * Collection picker.
    * Optional section heading.
    * Adjustable number of products.
    * Adjustable maximum section width.
    * Adjustable desktop and mobile side padding.
    * Adjustable product-card gap.
    * Adjustable top and bottom spacing.
    * Option to show or hide product prices.
    * Option to show or hide the section heading.
    
    Style:
    
    The result should feel like a luxury fashion e-commerce product selection.
    
    Use clean typography, balanced spacing, and an editorial layout consistent with the Bonne Soirée aesthetic.
    
    The section must be fully responsive and compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
    
    Do not output Markdown code fences such as “```liquid” as visible text anywhere in the section.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #ebe4d8;
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.spacing_top_desktop }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.spacing_bottom_desktop }}px;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: {{ block.settings.padding_desktop }}px;
    padding-right: {{ block.settings.padding_desktop }}px;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 40px;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: #000000;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.gap }}px;
    background-color: #ebe4d8;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ebe4d8;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #ebe4d8;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ebe4d8;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: #000000;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #000000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .ai-featured-collection-price-sale-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: #000000;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: {{ block.settings.spacing_top_mobile }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.spacing_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-featured-collection-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: {{ block.settings.padding_mobile }}px;
      padding-right: {{ block.settings.padding_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-featured-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .ai-featured-collection-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-featured-collection-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.show_heading and block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-featured-collection-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.collection != blank %}
      <div class="ai-featured-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for product in block.settings.collection.products limit: block.settings.products_to_show %}
          <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-featured-collection-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-featured-collection-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if product.featured_image %}
                <img
                  src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                  alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                  class="ai-featured-collection-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}"
                  height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-featured-collection-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="ai-featured-collection-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-featured-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.title }}</h3>
              {% if block.settings.show_price %}
                <div class="ai-featured-collection-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                    <span class="ai-featured-collection-price-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
                    <span class="ai-featured-collection-price-sale-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
                  {% else %}
                    {{ product.price | money }}
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="ai-featured-collection-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for i in (1..4) %}
          <div class="ai-featured-collection-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-featured-collection-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-featured-collection-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-featured-collection-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <h3 class="ai-featured-collection-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Product title</h3>
              {% if block.settings.show_price %}
                <div class="ai-featured-collection-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">R$ 0,00</div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class FeaturedCollection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
      }
    }

    customElements.define('featured-collection-{{ ai_gen_id }}', FeaturedCollection{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Featured collection",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "products_to_show",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 12,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "Products to show",
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_heading",
      "label": "Show heading",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "max_width",
      "min": 1000,
      "max": 1600,
      "step": 20,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Maximum width",
      "default": 1440
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "gap",
      "min": 8,
      "max": 48,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Gap between products",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing desktop"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_desktop",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Side padding",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "spacing_top_desktop",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Top spacing",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "spacing_bottom_desktop",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Bottom spacing",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing mobile"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Side padding",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "spacing_top_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Top spacing",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "spacing_bottom_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Bottom spacing",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Product display"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_price",
      "label": "Show price",
      "default": true
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Featured collection"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
